---
title: "T3 return: card waits, sweep receipts, origin must wake"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: returning
    lg2: settled
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 pink
  s0: Run in flight
  s1: Run finished, sweep not yet seen
  s2: Receipt parked, wake on the way
  s3: Origin awake, ingestion pending
  s4: Origin ingested #8212; closing follows
  s5: Card closed #8212; origin was told
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the T3 run ends
  s1 --> s2: sweep writes the return receipt
  s2 --> s3: the notifier wakes the origin session
  s3 --> s4: the origin records ingestion or a reason
  s4 --> s5: sweep closes the card [with ingestion or a reason]
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 teal
  class s4 teal
  class s5 pink
